{
  "name": "2026-10-01_1511_v3_30_cad_rotate_hover",
  "description": "ATLAS V3_30 as drawn (airframes/atlas_v3_30.json, SMALL_SCALE_V3_30.step: 14.4 kg, foils 49.6 / 58.2 / 49.5 deg outer / middle / inner): parked on its CAD feet and front foot (about -18 deg), the nose fans M7-M9 rotate it up to the trim hover pitch at 3 deg/s, arm in Stabilized and climb as soon as armed, lift off to 2.5 m, 60 s hands-off hover, gentle landing, nose lowered back to the parked pitch. MC_AIRMODE 0, H-FLOW as built.",
